{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Debouncing waits until calls stop for a configured duration, then runs the latest call. Choose your framework to see lifecycle-aware examples and the most useful API for search, validation, autosave, and similar operations."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"choose-your-framework","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Choose your framework"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../framework/vanilla/guides/debouncing.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vanilla"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../framework/react/guides/debouncing.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../framework/preact/guides/debouncing.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Preact"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../framework/solid/guides/debouncing.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solid"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../framework/angular/guides/debouncing.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Angular"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../framework/vue/guides/debouncing.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vue"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../framework/svelte/guides/debouncing.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Svelte"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../framework/lit/guides/debouncing.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lit"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../framework/alpine/guides/debouncing.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Alpine"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../framework/ember/guides/debouncing.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Ember"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../framework/octane/guides/debouncing.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Octane"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Not sure which operation fits your use case? Start with "},{"type":"link","href":"./which-pacer-utility-should-i-choose.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Which Pacer Utility Should I Choose?"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"choose-your-framework","text":"Choose your framework","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDebouncing waits until calls stop for a configured duration, then runs the latest call. Choose your framework to see lifecycle-aware examples and the most useful API for search, validation, autosave, and similar operations.\n\n## Choose your framework\n\n- [Vanilla](../framework/vanilla/guides/debouncing.md)\n- [React](../framework/react/guides/debouncing.md)\n- [Preact](../framework/preact/guides/debouncing.md)\n- [Solid](../framework/solid/guides/debouncing.md)\n- [Angular](../framework/angular/guides/debouncing.md)\n- [Vue](../framework/vue/guides/debouncing.md)\n- [Svelte](../framework/svelte/guides/debouncing.md)\n- [Lit](../framework/lit/guides/debouncing.md)\n- [Alpine](../framework/alpine/guides/debouncing.md)\n- [Ember](../framework/ember/guides/debouncing.md)\n- [Octane](../framework/octane/guides/debouncing.md)\n\nNot sure which operation fits your use case? Start with [Which Pacer Utility Should I Choose?](./which-pacer-utility-should-i-choose.md).\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Debouncing Guide\nid: debouncing\n---\n\nDebouncing waits until calls stop for a configured duration, then runs the latest call. Choose 